Subject: [PATCH] novena: reproduce bd5c7d3 DDR sequence board locally

NOVENA-DDR-IMPLEMENT-168. Apply after project patches 0001-0008.
Supersedes active DDR experiments 0009-0013; their files remain preserved.
Historical source: xobs/u-boot-novena bd5c7d3290bb94bf8af17760c321df67d2641343.
Target: ece349ade2973e220f524ce59e59711cc919263f (2026.07).
See docs/NOVENA-DDR-IMPLEMENT-168.md for provenance and deliberate quirks.
Source-only integration: no build or hardware qualification.

